              {
                "name": "pbt_harness",
                "path": "gpui/tests/pbt_harness",
                "c4_level": "unknown",
                "description": "Shared gpui PBT harness modules for the composed windowed path.",
                "pattern_status": "planned",
                "content": "Shared gpui PBT harness modules for the composed windowed path.\n\nIncrement 4c: the phased real-NSWindow shell (`run_in_gpui_window` +\n`OnReady`/`GpuiLaunchContext`, the phased ready-protocol) and the\nphased harnesses (`random_pbt`, `random_pbt_sim`, `windowed_replay`) were\nDELETED. The survivors are the composed windowed boot/replay helper\n(`windowed_wide`) and the TestPlatform `SimUserDriver`\n(`sim_windowed_replay`); the windowed random runner is the 4b loop in\n`gpui_composed_windowed_loop.rs`.\n\nIncluded via `#[path = \"pbt_harness/mod.rs\"] mod pbt_harness;` from each\ntest binary (subdir modules aren't auto-discovered as tests).",
                "source_file": "gpui/tests/pbt_harness/mod.rs",
                "parent": "gpui",
                "files": [
                  {
                    "name": "capture.rs"
                  },
                  {
                    "name": "mod.rs"
                  },
                  {
                    "name": "sim_windowed_replay.rs"
                  },
                  {
                    "name": "windowed_wide.rs"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
