      {
        "name": "holon-worker",
        "path": "holon-worker",
        "c4_level": "container",
        "description": "Holon worker — Phase 1 spike.",
        "pattern": "Worker",
        "pattern_status": "planned",
        "content": "@c4 container\n@c4 layer Services\nPattern: Worker\n\nHolon worker — Phase 1 spike.\n\nGoal: falsify or validate H2 (napi build from holon's repo) and H4 (tokio\non wasm32-wasip1-threads) before touching any holon code. This crate only\nexposes two entry points: [`ping`] and [`spawn_check`].\n\nSee ~/.claude/plans/nifty-bouncing-ladybug.md Phase 1 for the rationale.",
        "source_file": "holon-worker/src/lib.rs",
        "layer": "Services",
        "dirs": [
          {
